I am interested in learning more about cybersecurity. Cybersecurity’s main goal is to protect systems, networks, data, and more from digital attacks. I would like to go into digital forensics which is a part of cybersecurity. My mom and sister work in IT and cybersecurity but I have always been interested in forensics, and after some research, found that digital forensics might be the best fit for me. I am super interested in how these experts preserve and extract evidence and the many techniques that they have to use like image rendering, metadata analysis, and steganography detection. Understanding these things is very interesting to me and will help me in the long run when I start my career. 
